{"game": "risk-of-rain-returns", "language": "english", "appid": 1337520, "month": "2025-08", "window": 3, "start_date": 1755302400, "end_date": 1755993599, "month_true_total": 86, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 00:54:26 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "202741406", "author": {"steamid": "76561198164391726", "personaname": "sonagi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/im_sonagi/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 19679, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14365, "last_played": 1783053629, "avatar": "b5b9f67d71cf7f93c782feb52fb7f5c890e9dcde"}, "language": "english", "review": "OG fans of ROR1 will love the remastered version, it's my go to instead of the original now. Love the new iterations of the maps, skills redone, everything! I can't wish for a better game for even more replay ability than the first. Not sure what to say to those who like ROR2 as the 3D was less appealing for me + the whole enshitification and whatnot with DLC, but this is a solid standalone game with love felt for the first game.", "timestamp_created": 1755981721, "timestamp_updated": 1755981721, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202716094", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053620948", "personaname": "Gravesire", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198053620948/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 155, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 155, "last_played": 1755955433, "avatar": "8442685651231b08503c282a75c5f324df2ae085"}, "language": "english", "review": "I never played the original but love risk of rain 2 so I wanted to try